WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
Hampstead Heath, in north London,
has more than 30 lakes and ponds.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.610
On one, the Model Boating Pond, coots,
tufted ducks and great crested grebes use

3
00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.230
a small island.

4
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.450
The Heath records 18 species
of dragonfly and damselfly.

5
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.350
In ponds like this, water
fleas graze on algae.

6
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:24.630
So what happens to the whole pond
when just one thing in it changes?

7
00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.090
In this mission, you'll
find the pond's producers,

8
00:00:27.140 --> 00:00:31.030
its consumers, and the
decomposers in the mud.

9
00:00:31.080 --> 00:00:35.150
Then you'll build food chains, and
follow nutrients from the mud to plants,

10
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.670
to animals, and back again.

11
00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:42.270
Your mission: find out what happens to
a whole pond when just one thing in it

12
00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:43.080
changes.
